#: ../../source/start-here.rst:143
msgid "Working"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:145
msgid "There is a very simple workflow for Diátaxis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:149
msgid ":ref:`how-to-use-diataxis`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:151
msgid ""
"Consider what you see in the documentation, in front of you right now "
"(which might be literally nothing, if you haven't started yet)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:153
msgid "Ask: *is there any way in which it could be improved?*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:155
msgid ""
"Decide on *one* thing you could do to it right now, however small, that "
"would improve it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:157
msgid "Do that thing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:159
msgid "And then repeat."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:161
msgid "That's it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:167
msgid "Do what you like"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:169
msgid ""
"You can do what you like with Diátaxis. You don't have to believe in it "
"and there is no exam. It is a wholly pragmatic approach. I think it's "
"*true*, but what matters is that it actually helps people create better "
"documentation. If you find one idea or insight in it that seems to be "
"worthwhile, help yourself to that."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:171
msgid ""
"There is an extensively elaborated theory around Diátaxis, but you don't "
"need to subscribe to it, or even read about it. Diátaxis doesn't require "
"a commitment to pursue it to a final end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:173
msgid ""
"You can do just one thing, right now, and even if you do nothing else "
"ever after, you will at least have made that one improvement. (In "
"practice what you will find is that each thing you do will give you a "
"clue as to the next thing to do - you only need to keep doing them.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:177
msgid "Get started"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:179
msgid ""
"At this point, you have read everything you need to get started with "
"Diátaxis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/start-here.rst:181
msgid ""
"You can read more if you want, and eventually you probably should, but "
"*you will get the most value from the guidance in this website when you "
"turn to it with a problem or a question*. That's when it comes alive."
msgstr ""

